sequenceDiagram
    participant Visitor as Visitor (Kiosk)
    participant UI as Kiosk UI (Next.js)
    participant OtpAPI as POST /api/otp
    participant ValidateAPI as POST /api/otp/validate
    participant ConsentAPI as POST /api/consentimientos
    participant AdminSDK as Admin SDK (server)
    participant AuthSvc as authService
    participant RateLimit as rateLimitService
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant Resend as Resend Email

    Note over Visitor,FS: === PHASE 1: OTP Challenge Request ===

    Visitor->>UI: Enter email or document ID
    UI->>OtpAPI: POST { cedula, email }
    OtpAPI->>AuthSvc: requestOtpChallenge({ cedula, email, clientIp })
    AuthSvc->>AuthSvc: Use email directly or resolve cedula → email
    AuthSvc->>FS: getActiveOtp(email) → check existing challenge

    alt Existing challenge active
        AuthSvc-->>OtpAPI: 429 — OTP already sent or locked
    else No active challenge
        AuthSvc->>RateLimit: checkRateLimit(identifier, 3/5min)
        AuthSvc->>RateLimit: checkRateLimit(ip, 9/5min)

        alt Rate limit exceeded
            AuthSvc-->>OtpAPI: 429 — Too many requests
        else Within budget
            AuthSvc->>FS: saveOtp(email, code) → otp_challenges
            AuthSvc->>Resend: sendOtpEmail(email, code)
            Resend-->>Visitor: OTP code via email
            AuthSvc-->>OtpAPI: 200 — OTP sent
        end
    end

    OtpAPI-->>UI: Response (200 / 429)

    Note over Visitor,FS: === PHASE 2: OTP Validation ===

    Visitor->>UI: Enter OTP code
    UI->>ValidateAPI: POST { cedula, code }
    ValidateAPI->>AuthSvc: validateOtpChallengeRequest({ cedula, code })
    AuthSvc->>AuthSvc: resolveOtpValidationContext(cedula) → email

    alt Lockout active
        AuthSvc-->>ValidateAPI: 429 — OTP_LOCKED, retryAfter
    else
        AuthSvc->>RateLimit: checkRateLimit(identifier, 5/5min)

        alt Rate limit exceeded
            AuthSvc-->>ValidateAPI: 429 — Too many validation attempts
        else Within budget
            AuthSvc->>FS: Transaction: validateOtp(email, code)

            alt Code expired
                FS-->>AuthSvc: Delete challenge
                AuthSvc-->>ValidateAPI: 404 — OTP_EXPIRED
            else Code incorrect
                FS-->>AuthSvc: Increment attempts
                alt Attempts ≥ 5
                    FS-->>AuthSvc: Lock for OTP_LOCKOUT_MINUTES (15 min)
                    AuthSvc-->>ValidateAPI: 429 — OTP_LOCKED
                else Attempts < 5
                    AuthSvc-->>ValidateAPI: 404 — OTP_INVALID
                end
            else Code correct
                FS-->>AuthSvc: Clear attempts + lockout
                AuthSvc->>FS: createOtpSession(userId) → otp_access_sessions
                AuthSvc-->>ValidateAPI: 200 — Session created (120 min)
            end
        end
    end

    ValidateAPI-->>UI: Response (200 / 404 / 429)

    Note over Visitor,FS: === PHASE 3: Consent Creation (Session Guard) ===

    Visitor->>UI: Sign consent form
    UI->>ConsentAPI: POST { responsibleAdult, minors, signature }
    ConsentAPI->>AuthSvc: verifyOtpSession(userId)

    alt Session valid (split model)
        AuthSvc->>FS: Read otp_access_sessions → valid + not expired
        AuthSvc-->>ConsentAPI: valid = true, source = "split"
    else Session valid (legacy fallback)
        AuthSvc->>FS: Read otp_sessions → valid + not expired
        AuthSvc-->>ConsentAPI: valid = true, source = "legacy"
    else Session invalid/expired
        AuthSvc->>FS: Delete expired session
        AuthSvc-->>ConsentAPI: valid = false
        ConsentAPI-->>UI: 401 — Session invalid
    end

    alt Session valid
        ConsentAPI->>AdminSDK: createConsent(payload)
        AdminSDK->>FS: Write consent + update user + minors_index
        AdminSDK->>FS: Store signature blob
        AdminSDK-->>ConsentAPI: 201 — consentId
        ConsentAPI-->>UI: 201 — Consent recorded
    end

    Note over Visitor,FS: === ADMIN AUTH (separate flow) ===

    Note over AdminSDK: Admin login: Firebase Auth
    Note over AdminSDK: Custom Claims → role in JWT
    Note over AdminSDK: Session cookie: jp_admin_session (30 min)
    Note over AdminSDK: Permission check via hasPermission()
    Note over AdminSDK: Route guard via verifyAdminToken()
